{"reviewId": "380402079_80LZmC5lv", "review": {"abstract": "中国经济增速放缓已经与当前的全球通胀下降绑在一起，没有中国需求的弱化又怎会有大宗商品尤其是能源价格的阶段性回落，这也意味着，近期的石油包括煤炭价格上涨撇除美元的标价因素，真正的需求增长依然存在。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "04 长波衰退中的增长与通胀", "chapterUid": 9, "content": "这就是前面说的中国因素，美国经济衰退，但是能源还在上涨，新兴经济体和资源制造国的需求在上涨，所以这个不是同步的。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "22037-22134", "createTime": 1749446674, "title": "", "type": 1, "reviewId": "380402079_80LZmC5lv", "userVid": 380402079, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 9, "chapterTitle": "04 长波衰退中的增长与通胀", "author": {"userVid": 380402079, "name": "@雁菁💞", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0013-YP88sMnDO5fc6f~Xb7tXUf6/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "@雁菁💞", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "文字中谋心，阅读中谋趣，烟火中谋生。", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "人丑就要多读书，腹有诗书气自华。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-500", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 500}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 19, "likes": [{"userVid": 414458585, "name": "🌲", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0002-qHEk9NbwnipEQVkzI37JJ10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-100", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 100}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [{"content": "美国经济回落，是消费国的需求减少了，对应的制造国的出口必然减少。\n1.相应速度没有那么快。\n2.中国生产的惯性，